## Installation
{% if is_app %}
`{{github_repo_name}}` is a standalone end-user tool whose primary command is `{{github_repo_name}}`. Install it into an isolated environment:

```console
uv tool install {{github_repo_name}}
```

Or run it without installing with `uvx {{github_repo_name}}`. See the [installation docs](https://{{github_user}}.github.io/{{github_repo_name}}/installation.html) for pipx and from-source options.
{% if include_homebrew %}
Install with [Homebrew](https://brew.sh) (macOS/Linux):

```sh
brew install {{github_user}}/tap/{{github_repo_name}}
```
{% endif -%}
{% if include_scoop %}
Install with [Scoop](https://scoop.sh) (Windows):

```sh
scoop bucket add {{github_user}} https://github.com/{{github_user}}/scoop-bucket
scoop install {{github_user}}/{{github_repo_name}}
```
{% endif -%}
{% else %}
`{{github_repo_name}}` is a library. Add it to your project as a dependency:

```console
